  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "You are given arrays AAA and BBB of sizes NNN and MMM respectively, such that 1≤Bi≤N1\\le B_i \\le N1≤Bi​≤N.\n\nFor each 1≤i≤M1\\le i \\le M1≤i≤M:\n\n\nSort the suffix of length BiB_iBi​ in array AAA in non-decreasing order.\nOutput the resultant array AAA after all operations.\n\nNote that a suffix of length XXX denotes the subarray consisting of last XXX elements of the array.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line consists of a single integer TTT, denoting the number of test cases.\nThe first line of each test case consists of two space-separated integers NNN and MMM, denoting the sizes of arrays AAA and BBB.\nThe second line of each test case consists of NNN space separated integers A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​.\nThe third line of each test case consists of MMM space separated integers B1,B2,…,BMB_1, B_2, \\ldots, B_MB1​,B2​,…,BM​.\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, output NNN space-separated integers, denoting the resultant array AAA after all operations.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤1051 \\leq T \\leq 10^51≤T≤105",
      "1≤N,M≤2⋅1051 \\leq N, M \\leq 2 \\cdot 10^51≤N,M≤2⋅105",
      "1≤Ai≤1071 \\leq A_i \\leq 10^71≤Ai​≤107",
      "1≤Bi≤N1 \\leq B_i \\leq N1≤Bi​≤N",
      "The sum of NNN and MMM over all test cases would not exceed 2⋅1052\\cdot 10^52⋅105 respectively."
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
    "notes": [],
    "sampleTestCases": [
      {
        "id": "sample_1",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "2\n5 1\n2 3 4 6 1\n2\n6 3\n5 7 12 11 13 10\n1 2 4",
        "output": "2 3 4 1 6\n5 7 10 11 12 13",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 111: Initially, A=[2,3,4,6,1]A = [2, 3, 4, 6, 1]A=[2,3,4,6,1]. After sorting the suffix of length 222, the array changes to A=[2,3,4,1,6]A = [2, 3, 4, 1, 6]A=[2,3,4,1,6].\nTest case 222:\n\nB1=1B_1 = 1B1​=1: A=[5,7,12,11,13,10]A = [5, 7, 12, 11, 13, 10]A=[5,7,12,11,13,10]\nB2=2B_2 = 2B2​=2: A=[5,7,12,11,10,13]A = [5, 7, 12, 11, 10, 13]A=[5,7,12,11,10,13]\nB3=4B_3 = 4B3​=4: A=[5,7,10,11,12,13]A = [5, 7, 10, 11, 12, 13]A=[5,7,10,11,12,13]\n\nThus, the final array is A=[5,7,10,11,12,13]A = [5, 7, 10, 11, 12, 13]A=[5,7,10,11,12,13]."
      }
    ]
  },
